  "sections": [
    {
      "block_id": "h1-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": "Textual Rig Console — Slice 6: Coordination/Session Enrichment",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-2",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Status",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "**Complete.** Adds coordination store reading for lane_id, last_heartbeat_at, and current_step fields in `RuntimeDashboardProjectionProvider`, along with constructor overrides for lane_id and task_title. Tolerates missing/malformed coordination data gracefully.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-4",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Motivation",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Slice 5 populated `SessionPaneProjection` from receipt index data alone, leaving several fields (`lane_id`, `task_title`, `last_heartbeat_at`, `current_step`) as `None` or a static fallback. These fields are available from the coordination store (`CoordinationSession` JSON files), which tracks cross-session task claims, heartbeats, and session lifecycle.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Adding coordination reading to the provider fills these gaps without changing widget code or the projection model surface.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-7",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "What Changed",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h3-8",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "`providers.py` (`CoordinationDashboardSummary` + `_read_coordination_summary`)",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-9",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "1. **`CoordinationDashboardSummary` model** — content-light Pydantic model with `extra=\"forbid\"`. Fields:",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "table-10",
      "type": "table",
      "columns": [
        "Field",
        "Type",
        "Source"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "`lane_id`",
          "`str \\",
          "None`",
          "Coordination session `task_id`"
        ],
        [
          "`task_title`",
          "`str \\",
          "None`",
          "Not directly available from store"
        ],
        [
          "`last_heartbeat_at`",
          "`str \\",
          "None`",
          "Coordination `updated_at`"
        ],
        [
          "`current_step`",
          "`str \\",
          "None`",
          "Coordination `status`"
        ],
        [
          "`pending_user_action`",
          "`str \\",
          "None`",
          "Reserved (not yet available)"
        ],
        [
          "`session_status`",
          "`str \\",
          "None`",
          "Coordination `status`"
        ],
        [
          "`warnings`",
          "`list[str]`",
          "Malformed-JSON flag"
        ]
      ],
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-11",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "2. **`_read_coordination_summary()`** — file-level helper that reads `{coordination_root}/sessions/{session_id}.json` and parses with `CoordinationSession.model_validate()`. Returns a `CoordinationDashboardSummary` in all paths:",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-12",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "- `coordination_root is None` → empty summary - Session file missing → empty summary - Malformed JSON → empty summary with `warnings=[\"Malformed coordination session file\"]` - Valid JSON → populated summary from coordination fields",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-13",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "3. **Constructor params added** to `RuntimeDashboardProjectionProvider`:",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-14",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "```python coordination_root: Path | None = None session_root: Path | None = None  # Reserved lane_id: str | None = None        # Overrides coordination task_title: str | None = None     # Explicit only ```",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-15",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "4. **`_build_session()` updated** — calls `_read_coordination_summary()` and applies the precedence: explicit constructor params override coordination-derived values. Receipt-derived fields are unchanged.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h3-16",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "Precedence Rules",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "table-17",
      "type": "table",
      "columns": [
        "Field",
        "Precedence"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "`lane_id`",
          "Constructor `lane_id` > coordination `task_id` > `None`"
        ],
        [
          "`task_title`",
          "Constructor `task_title` > `None`"
        ],
        [
          "`last_heartbeat_at`",
          "Coordination `updated_at` > `None`"
        ],
        [
          "`current_step`",
          "Coordination `status` > `\"No active session data\"`"
        ],
        [
          "`validate_status`, `receipt_count`, `changed_paths`",
          "Receipt index only (unchanged)"
        ]
      ],
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h3-18",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "Error Tolerance",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-19",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "All three failure modes return a clean projection with coordination fields set to `None`/`\"No active session data\"` — no exception propagates to the caller. Receipt-derived data is unaffected.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-20",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Updates to Existing Files",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "table-21",
      "type": "table",
      "columns": [
        "File",
        "Change"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "`vibe/cli/textual_ui/rig_console/providers.py`",
          "Added `CoordinationDashboardSummary`, `_read_coordination_summary()`, 4 new constructor params, `_build_session()` calls `_read_coordination_summary()`"
        ],
        [
          "`tests/cli/textual_ui/rig_console/test_providers.py`",
          "12 new tests in `TestCoordinationEnrichment` class"
        ],
        [
          "`docs/ui/textual-rig-console-slice-5-runtime-provider.md`",
          "Updated constructor, data sources, field mapping table, Future Provider Path"
        ],
        [
          "`docs/ui/textual-rig-console-slice-5-1-worker-refresh.md`",
          "Added callable-vs-coroutine explanation for RuntimeWarning fix"
        ]
      ],
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-22",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "What This Slice Intentionally Does Not Do",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-23",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "- Does not modify legacy VibeApp or its TCSS files - Does not wire mutation actions - Does not execute validate or any tool from the TUI - Does not parse raw observability payloads in widgets/screens - Does not add real-time/frequent polling - Does not add session lifecycle directory scanning (multi-session views) - Does not resolve branch_name (not available from coordination store) - Does not resolve pending_user_action (not yet tracked) - Does not mutate coordination files or repair leases - Does not crawl the coordination directory tree",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-24",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "New Test Coverage",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-25",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "`TestCoordinationEnrichment` (12 tests):",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "table-26",
      "type": "table",
      "columns": [
        "Test",
        "What It Verifies"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "`test_missing_coordination_root_returns_clean_projection`",
          "`coordination_root=None` → fields stay None/default"
        ],
        [
          "`test_missing_coordination_dir_returns_clean_projection`",
          "Non-existent coordination dir → no crash"
        ],
        [
          "`test_missing_session_file_is_tolerated`",
          "Missing session JSON → clean projection, receipts still work"
        ],
        [
          "`test_malformed_coordination_json_is_tolerated`",
          "Garbage JSON → empty summary, receipt data unaffected"
        ],
        [
          "`test_lane_id_from_coordination_propagates`",
          "Coordination `task_id` → `lane_id`"
        ],
        [
          "`test_explicit_lane_id_overrides_coordination`",
          "Constructor `lane_id` overrides coordination `task_id`"
        ],
        [
          "`test_explicit_task_title_propagates`",
          "Constructor `task_title` appears in projection"
        ],
        [
          "`test_last_heartbeat_at_from_coordination`",
          "Coordination `updated_at` → `last_heartbeat_at`"
        ],
        [
          "`test_current_step_from_coordination`",
