          "`validate_status`, `receipt_count`, `status` unchanged by coordination"
        ]
      ],
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "detailed",
        "collapsible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-27",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Risk and Verification",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-28",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "- **Risk**: None. Coordination store is read-only, missing data is tolerated, explicit overrides take priority. No change to receipt index or evidence rail logic. - **Verification**: 25 provider tests pass (13 existing + 12 new), all 29 dashboard screen tests pass, ruff/pyright clean.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-29",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Next Slice (7)",
